{"4304360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mine Liebe Musik 1", "steam_appid": 4304360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>MineLiebeMusik</i></strong> is a story-driven bullet-hell adventure series.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a ruthless sci-fi world governed by survival of the fittest, it follows the wickedly unscrupulous protagonist, Azalea, as she struggles to survive at any cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge relentless barrages of enemy fire and push her story forward through absurd conversations and unforgiving choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Synopsis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the extinction of humanity, a highly advanced information-based lifeform known as “Harmonia” rose to build a new civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For beings without sex, lifespan, or even the risk of death, killing, hurling insults, and even sex itself are nothing more than forms of entertainment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Into this stagnant world steps an anomaly—the protagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And to the bored Harmonia, she is nothing more than fleeting amusement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Difficulty</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This title is not a traditional bullet-hell shooter, but a story-driven adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As such, the difficulty of the bullet-hell segments has been tuned to be accessible, allowing even players unfamiliar with the genre to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>No difficulty options are available.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A World That Embraces Nihilism</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world built on survival of the fittest, there is no morality—no catharsis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If anything, making others suffer is part of the appeal, and redemption is simply dull.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this cruel yet strangely elegant world of bullet and barbed words,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >only a protagonist as wicked as she is refined truly belongs.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>MineLiebeMusik</i></strong> is a story-driven bullet-hell adventure series.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a ruthless sci-fi world governed by survival of the fittest, it follows the wickedly unscrupulous protagonist, Azalea, as she struggles to survive at any cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge relentless barrages of enemy fire and push her story forward through absurd conversations and unforgiving choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Synopsis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the extinction of humanity, a highly advanced information-based lifeform known as “Harmonia” rose to build a new civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For beings without sex, lifespan, or even the risk of death, killing, hurling insults, and even sex itself are nothing more than forms of entertainment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Into this stagnant world steps an anomaly—the protagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And to the bored Harmonia, she is nothing more than fleeting amusement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Difficulty</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This title is not a traditional bullet-hell shooter, but a story-driven adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As such, the difficulty of the bullet-hell segments has been tuned to be accessible, allowing even players unfamiliar with the genre to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>No difficulty options are available.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A World That Embraces Nihilism</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world built on survival of the fittest, there is no morality—no catharsis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If anything, making others suffer is part of the appeal, and redemption is simply dull.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this cruel yet strangely elegant world of bullet and barbed words,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >only a protagonist as wicked as she is refined truly belongs.</p>", "short_description": "A quirky, story-driven bullet-hell adventure where a cast of chic, sharp-tongued characters put on an elegant display of danmaku while trading crude, biting insults with each other. You’re invited to the first chapter of a strange and fateful tale—about 30 minutes of bullet-hell gameplay.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304360/3981c07ef837592e860cd2a246f3af6a81bf7753/header.jpg?t=1786762184", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304360/2844c1b7085f842b474dd4d941938dce850578bc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786762184", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304360/2844c1b7085f842b474dd4d941938dce850578bc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786762184", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows10,11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Processor: Intel Core i3 or AMD Ryzen 3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics supported<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Rec